      "writtenOn": "2017-09-20T09:40:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is incorrect, we don\u0027t want to SOFT_RESET if the other side just ignore our VDM (unsupported/unrecognized) while it did GOOD_CRC it.\n\nFor PD2.0 Ignoring VDM is the proper behavior,\nand for PD.30, see table 6-58 in PD 3.0 spec and \"An unrecognized or unsupported Message received in the PE_SNK_Ready or PE_SRC_Ready states, Shall Not cause a Soft_Reset Message to be generated but instead a Not_Supported Message Shall be generated.\"",
